# Gatotkaca, Mighty Legend

> Gatotkaca is a tank that punishes tunneling. His kit is built around one bet: the enemy team will keep attacking him after he taunts them, and he will get stronger the more they do. Break that assumption and he is a slow, escape-less statue with a telegraphed ultimate.

