## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-02. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Vengeance Punish (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Cursed Helmet, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when burst magic can remove you before Rage, Vengeance, and Brave Smite stabilize the engage.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use into repeated magic damage that keeps tagging you during Lord and mid-river fights.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when physical skill burst is the main threat and Dominance Ice already covers sustain suppression.; Blade Armor over Oracle when Use only when the enemy marksman must basic attack through your taunt to win fights.
- Total cost: 10420 gold

Default roam setup for forcing enemies to hit Gatotkaca while Cursed Helmet, Thunder Belt, Vengeance, and team buffs punish the contact.

### EXP Thunder Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when control chains are light and the first trades decide lane access.; Cursed Helmet over Antique Cuirass when Use when wave clear and body-range damage matter more than reducing physical skill burst.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use against one-shot magic burst that can kill you before your second enhanced basic attack.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use before the final Lord stage when repeated rotations matter more than a single revive.
- Total cost: 10680 gold

EXP lane setup for steady Thunder Belt stacking, anti-sustain utility, and long brawls where Vengeance converts focus fire into value.

### EXP Hybrid Dive (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand, Brute Force Breastplate, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Tenacity, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Glowing Wand when Use when the enemy sustain comes from heroes near Gatotkaca rather than the target he is burning. Lifebane does not stack across the two, and Fortress Shield scales hybrid defense in grouped fights.; Oracle over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when your team has healing or shielding that lets you stay in the second rotation.; Radiant Armor over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against repeated magic poke that reaches you before the dive begins.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use when you need to buy two seconds after landing Avatar of the Guardian and no other active equipment is in the build.
- Total cost: 10580 gold

Lead-only EXP variant for games with another primary tank, adding magic threat while keeping enough durability to finish the dive.

